# auth0/ (Terraform, specs/012 research R17): local state and plans can hold tenant data, and tfvars name the tenant.
# SPEC 1.26: all three live outside every checkout, in ~/x402-tfstate on the operator's host (scripts/auth0-tenant.sh),
# never here. The provider lock file (.terraform.lock.hcl) is committed.
auth0/.terraform/
auth0/*.tfstate
auth0/*.tfstate.*
auth0/*.tfplan
auth0/*.tfvars
crash.log
